                  "description": "End of date range as Unix timestamp.",
                  "key": "date_to",
                  "value": "<integer>"
                },
                {
                  "description": "Maximum number of results to return.",
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "<integer>"
                },
                {
                  "description": "JSON-encoded array of filter objects with field, operator (is, is not, is like, matching, not matching), and value keys.\n",
                  "key": "filters",
                  "value": "<string>"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns aggregated analytics data. Rate limited to 10 requests per minute. Supports grouping by time period and dimension fields, sorting, filtering, and timezone-aware date ranges.\n"
